From 7c0e272e2c054b4a8183332652f9bed6a3d6f762 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 10:06:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: resume video playback from last position

- Progress model: add lastPositionSec + updatedAt
- getPath: surface lastPositionSec per video in PathView
- trackProgress: saveVideoPosition() upserts last position
- /api/progress: accept optional positionSec alongside watched
- VideoEmbed: seek to saved position on load, report position
  every 5s while playing and on pause/unmount
- TopicWaypoint/PathRoadmap: wire onProgress through to the API,
  show a small 'Resuming from mm:ss' hint
